{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1390971-symbols-for-the-traditions-as-a-whole","id":1390971,"title":"Symbols for the Traditions as a whole","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-23T08:02:27-07:00","id":1390971,"title":"Symbols for the Traditions as a whole","content":"Hi. <br /> <br /> Are there any symbols for the Traditions as a whole? Just like the Technocracy one, you know...<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T08:16:01-07:00","id":1390974,"title":"","content":"Sort of. There's a crest which has only ever appeared once as far as I know, and it may have been meant to represent the Council itself rather than the Traditions as a whole.<br /> <br /> You can see it here: <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Council_of_Nine\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Council_of_Nine</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T08:25:42-07:00","id":1390977,"title":"","content":"OMG, that's a terrible crest lol<br /> <br /> It's incredible no one in White Wolf thought about giving the Traditions a decent symbol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T10:19:00-07:00","id":1390991,"title":"","content":"I could imagine that as their first crest. They should have something better by now. Or maybe they decided a symbol for the council might be used against them by non-tradition mages... Or they just could never agree on one","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T12:54:13-07:00","id":1391027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1390971-symbols-for-the-traditions-as-a-whole?p=1390991#post1390991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or they just could never agree on one</div> </div> </div> </div>You know it's this one.<br /> <br /> &quot;OK, so all the Tradition symbols surround the unicorn. Which one goes on top?&quot;<br /> &gt;Fifteen years of arguing&lt;<br /> &quot;Fine! Just make them all lions. God, I hate this place!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T14:32:12-07:00","id":1391050,"title":"","content":"I'm not aware of any besides the main one however in practice things such as Tarot Decks and (the Hermetic symbol for?) Prime often appear as calling cards (pun intended) of the Council of Traditions.<br /> <br /> If I had to brainstorm another I could see a nine-pointed star or a geocentric cosmological model with 9 rings potentially functioning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T17:09:20-07:00","id":1391073,"title":"","content":"I like the Prime symbol idea, or that complicated Prime/Correspondence dual symbol (I am not sure which Mage game that is from). I am not so much a fan of anything indicating the number nine, as this implies the Traditions always have at least nine factions and never more than that. If I understand the lore, at one point it dropped to a council of only seven for some time. I like the idea of a potential Council of eleven or thirteen.<br /> Here is a link. The Royal Club Chantry symbol. I dig it. I think this is a personal campaighn website. Whomever designed this has my appreciation. It is an amalgamation of each sphere symbol it seems.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/rosaumbra/4516388174/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/rosaumbra/4516388174/</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25651,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25651-marko-markoko","user":"Marko Markoko","date":".  Added llink to image I am referring to 05-23-2020, 08:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25651-marko-markoko","name":"Marko Markoko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25651_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T00:29:29-07:00","id":1391140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marko Markoko</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1390971-symbols-for-the-traditions-as-a-whole?p=1391073#post1391073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> If I understand the lore, at one point it dropped to a council of only seven for some time. I like the idea of a potential Council of eleven or thirteen.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>They've actually never gone below eight, but I agree that they shouldn't get too attached to the number 9. There are other numbers with perfectly lovely magickal significance out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}